msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

msgid "Indicates that a node belongs to a spatial / locational group (LocationNodeGroup). Membership is m:n (multiple is\\_in\\_location edges per source are allowed) and additive (memberships compose; none overrides). The optional 'is\\_primary' attribute on at most one edge per source disambiguates which membership is rendered as a yEd group folder in em-graph. The same edge type also carries the recursive Location → Location hierarchy (Pompei → Sector 4 → Casa del Fauno → Room 12)."
msgstr ""

